    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1272">

                <pb facs="0878" n="762" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg762"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/12.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Consul Miller.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-09-24">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 24, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your September 18. Make earnest protest in case any attempt is made to extort
                    forced loans from American citizens. Keep the Department informed on the
                    subject.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
